* AD8551 Non-Inverting Amplifier, Gain = 100 V/V (40 dB), Single +5 V Supply
* Input: 10 mV amplitude, 1 kHz sine (biased at mid-supply)

.include AD8551.cir

* ---------------- Supplies ----------------
VCC   VCC  0   DC 5
VMID  VREF 0   DC 2.5          ; mid-supply reference for the gain network

* ---------------- Input source ----------------
* DC bias at mid-supply so the single-supply stage stays in its linear range
VIN   IN   0   SINE(2.5 10m 1k 0 0 0) AC 1

* ---------------- Amplifier ----------------
* X1 pins: +IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT
X1  IN  NEG  VCC  0  OUT  AD8551

* Gain setting network referenced to mid-supply: G = 1 + Rf/Rg = 1 + 99k/1k = 100
RG   NEG  VREF  1k
RF   OUT  NEG   99k

* ---------------- Load ----------------
RL   OUT  0     10k
CL   OUT  0     20p

* ---------------- Analysis ----------------
.tran 0 10m 0 1u
.ac dec 50 1 1Meg

.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7

.end
